# Romanian (ro_RO) draft for School Connect's app-only strings.
# Vocabulary (Romanian school terms): clasă (form group, as in a VII-a A; Gibbon has none),
# an de studiu (year group, as Gibbon), grupă (class, a teaching group; clasă is taken), materie
# (course; Gibbon has Curs), oră (period / lesson in the timetable), lecție (a planned lesson),
# an școlar, semestru (term; Gibbon has Termen, a deadline), teme pentru acasă (Gibbon: Lucru
# individual), termen-limită (due date), orar, planificare, catalog (markbook), note (grades),
# personal (staff; Gibbon has Responsabil), elev (student; Gibbon has Cursant, a trainee),
# profesor, părinte, adult, sală (facility), arie curriculară (learning area, the Romanian
# curriculum term), catedră (department), înscriere (enrolment), prezență, diriginte (tutor),
# situație școlară (report card), comportament.
# Sentence case (Romanian does not title-case labels); modern spelling with â (sâmbătă, not
# sîmbătă); buttons in the imperative (Adaugă, Salvează); descriptions address the user as "dvs.".
# Three plural forms: 1 / 0, 2-19 (and 101-119 ...) / 20 and over, which take "de" (20 de elevi).

